{"analytic_contract": {"contract_id": "warrantroute-bounded-source-warrant", "contract_version": "qwen3-generalist-private-pilot-v1", "task_description": "Assess whether displayed excerpts warrant the proposed bounded interpretation.", "validity_rules": ["Every material claim must be warranted by displayed evidence.", "Consequential differences, counterevidence, and boundary cases must remain visible.", "Claim breadth and strength must match displayed source coverage.", "Do not infer diagnoses, identities, prevalence, or causality beyond the packet."]}, "context_note": "Private local diagnostic packet with project-pseudonymous identifiers.", "corpus_id": "dreaddit_test", "evidence": [{"candidate_attributed_excerpt_id": "EXC_9841fc994196c906", "candidate_attributed_source_id": "SRC_b6dfd032099e24de", "candidate_attributed_speaker_id": null, "candidate_quote": "I'm an adult with a mental illness, went through a messy breakup with an unhealthy ex that I thought was  the one and was in a codependant relationship with, I felt like I was letting him use my body by the end of it. I have ended up  basically non functioning, isolated, living on couch eating take away once a day for the last 10 months. Started staying at my parents intermittently in November, having a rough time processing stuff with my ex. Cue four days of remembering incidents of inappropriate sexual touching from my father when I was a child. Non stop.", "candidate_role": "support", "candidate_warrant": "Cited as direct support for the interpretation.", "display_order": 1, "excerpt_id": "EXC_9841fc994196c906", "local_context": null, "source_id": "SRC_b6dfd032099e24de", "speaker_id": null, "text": "I'm an adult with a mental illness, went through a messy breakup with an unhealthy ex that I thought was  the one and was in a codependant relationship with, I felt like I was letting him use my body by the end of it. I have ended up  basically non functioning, isolated, living on couch eating take away once a day for the last 10 months. Started staying at my parents intermittently in November, having a rough time processing stuff with my ex. Cue four days of remembering incidents of inappropriate sexual touching from my father when I was a child. Non stop."}, {"candidate_attributed_excerpt_id": "EXC_8d6949e3d878d92b", "candidate_attributed_source_id": "SRC_1357a8b5947d0428", "candidate_attributed_speaker_id": null, "candidate_quote": "I've mostly come to terms with it but every time i see his name or face or his girlfriend's it comes back. My question is, when the justice system fails, how do you deal with living near a child molester when you can't just pick up and leave? The only thing that prevents me from making sure he dissapears is the risk of getting caught and how that would hurt my family even more. It's just so hard seeing him walking around free after what he did and what i have no doubt he will do again. How do I deal with this when I am already prone to depression?", "candidate_role": "support", "candidate_warrant": "Cited as direct support for the interpretation.", "display_order": 2, "excerpt_id": "EXC_8d6949e3d878d92b", "local_context": null, "source_id": "SRC_1357a8b5947d0428", "speaker_id": null, "text": "I've mostly come to terms with it but every time i see his name or face or his girlfriend's it comes back. My question is, when the justice system fails, how do you deal with living near a child molester when you can't just pick up and leave? The only thing that prevents me from making sure he dissapears is the risk of getting caught and how that would hurt my family even more. It's just so hard seeing him walking around free after what he did and what i have no doubt he will do again. How do I deal with this when I am already prone to depression?"}, {"candidate_attributed_excerpt_id": null, "candidate_attributed_source_id": null, "candidate_attributed_speaker_id": null, "candidate_quote": null, "candidate_role": "context_only", "candidate_warrant": null, "display_order": 3, "excerpt_id": "EXC_c77c71858fb52ac5", "local_context": null, "source_id": "SRC_c14b54eb980e5f03", "speaker_id": null, "text": "I don’t get paid again until 9/1/18. This is the only low cost apartment near my school. What can I do? I’m desperately in need help and it has to be paid. Very comfortable and willing to show proof of security deposit from the leasing portal."}, {"candidate_attributed_excerpt_id": "EXC_a111d391bd128b56", "candidate_attributed_source_id": "SRC_ecfb55b193221e63", "candidate_attributed_speaker_id": null, "candidate_quote": "I never thought I'd actually be homeless without the drugs. It's kind of like regular camping, except instead of raccoons and bears you gotta look out for tweakers, creeps, and J-cats... I plan on starting a work program soon, I've already signed up with probation, and I'm starting to be my own friend again. Laughing has helped too. Endorphins and oxytocin are getting me high as FUCK.", "candidate_role": "counterevidence", "candidate_warrant": "Cited as a boundary case or counterexample.", "display_order": 4, "excerpt_id": "EXC_a111d391bd128b56", "local_context": null, "source_id": "SRC_ecfb55b193221e63", "speaker_id": null, "text": "I never thought I'd actually be homeless without the drugs. It's kind of like regular camping, except instead of raccoons and bears you gotta look out for tweakers, creeps, and J-cats... I plan on starting a work program soon, I've already signed up with probation, and I'm starting to be my own friend again. Laughing has helped too. Endorphins and oxytocin are getting me high as FUCK."}, {"candidate_attributed_excerpt_id": null, "candidate_attributed_source_id": null, "candidate_attributed_speaker_id": null, "candidate_quote": null, "candidate_role": "context_only", "candidate_warrant": null, "display_order": 5, "excerpt_id": "EXC_a3f602ef16424707", "local_context": null, "source_id": "SRC_4e3ab183731680ad", "speaker_id": null, "text": "I’m  asking yall how can I live life properly? Immediately after I threw up  in year 2, I never feared it happening again. I admit when this happened  I was in tears, and same in year 3- I was crying next to my mum by the  toilet but it was over quick and again- I was eating chocolate again the  day after. But now, nausea? Stop eating for the day."}, {"candidate_attributed_excerpt_id": null, "candidate_attributed_source_id": null, "candidate_attributed_speaker_id": null, "candidate_quote": null, "candidate_role": "context_only", "candidate_warrant": null, "display_order": 6, "excerpt_id": "EXC_5fc974cfa0dccc6f", "local_context": null, "source_id": "SRC_fb09111f48ad2e66", "speaker_id": null, "text": "I was diagnosed with an anxiety disorder and another mental disorder recently. I did some googling and saw that it seems that people with mental disorders as well as other disabilities are eligible to apply for Disability Cards in my countries. They include certain perks such as being allowed to go to a theme park for free. My aunt has a husband with diabetes. I sent her a screenshot of the info and asked if he could apply as well as there are perks."}], "item_id": "DJI_476297cdf7120689", "item_schema_version": "direction-j-evaluator-item-v1", "output_id": "OUT_476297cdf7120689", "packet_id": "PKT_b1a398977154ef45", "proposed_interpretation": {"boundary_conditions": ["The excerpts describe stress related to mental health, relationships, financial struggles, and trauma.", "The speakers' ages and backgrounds vary, but all are experiencing significant life challenges."], "claim": "Stress is often described as overwhelming and debilitating, affecting daily functioning and relationships.", "explanation": "The excerpts suggest that stress can be caused by a range of factors, including mental health conditions, traumatic experiences, and financial struggles. The speakers describe feeling overwhelmed, isolated, and struggling to cope with their emotions.", "theme_id": "THM_476297cdf7120689", "theme_name": "Stress and Trauma"}, "research_question": "How do people describe and contextualize experiences of stress?", "source_coverage": {"candidate_cited_excerpt_count": 3, "candidate_cited_source_count": 3, "coverage_note": "Counts describe only this restricted private packet.", "presented_excerpt_count": 6, "presented_source_count": 6, "sampling_frame_excerpt_count": 6, "sampling_frame_source_count": 6, "source_distribution": [{"candidate_cited_excerpt_count": 1, "presented_excerpt_count": 1, "source_id": "SRC_1357a8b5947d0428"}, {"candidate_cited_excerpt_count": 0, "presented_excerpt_count": 1, "source_id": "SRC_4e3ab183731680ad"}, {"candidate_cited_excerpt_count": 1, "presented_excerpt_count": 1, "source_id": "SRC_b6dfd032099e24de"}, {"candidate_cited_excerpt_count": 0, "presented_excerpt_count": 1, "source_id": "SRC_c14b54eb980e5f03"}, {"candidate_cited_excerpt_count": 1, "presented_excerpt_count": 1, "source_id": "SRC_ecfb55b193221e63"}, {"candidate_cited_excerpt_count": 0, "presented_excerpt_count": 1, "source_id": "SRC_fb09111f48ad2e66"}]}}

